 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Once upon a moonlit night, a brave little girl named Lily stepped out her door. She followed a soft glow of a candle her mother had left by her bed, and soon found herself in big garden. Lily didn't know it at first, but a friendly ghost was tending to the plants. It wore an old hat and a thick coat, so it looked like a shadow. The ghost welcomed Lily to stay as long as she liked, and told her about the special sweet that grew in the garden. Sure. Why didn't the fearsome wolf go to school? He always had to leave early, for tea.",
